{
  "declaredLength": 2548,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我们为什么会在这种地方？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E3A4EC04E484F1A57288FD979CD573065B9FF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里是那个叫做\n异次元密阿雷的地方吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC662F90A34E2A53EB505A000A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F77684573065B95427FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样说来，我也是\n由某个人的潜意识创造出来的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968378BF46765FF0C62114E5F662F000A753167D04E2A4EBA76846F5C610F8BC6521B902051FA67657684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新闪焰队的二位，\n我有事想要问你们，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以请和我们对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65B095EA7130961F76844E8C4F4DFF0C000A621167094E8B60F3898195EE4F604EECFF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE58BF7548C62114EEC5BF962185427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，你也会帮忙的吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C4F604E5F4F1A5E2E5FD976845427FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F5371364E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来如此。\n你是打算先充分掌握现在的状况啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F676559826B643002000A4F60662F62537B97514851455206638C63E173B05728768472B651B5554A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要和你并肩作战，\n就能稳操胜券～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981548C4F605E7680A94F5C6218FF0C000A5C3180FD7A3364CD80DC5238FF5EFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为没被基格尔德选上，\n这份不甘一直在我心中烟雾缭绕……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我希望来一场对战，这样也好消除我的不甘。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A6CA188AB57FA683C5C145FB790094E0AFF0C000A8FD94EFD4E0D75184E0076F4572862115FC34E2D70DF96FE7F2D7ED52026202600100001BE00000A62115E0C671B67654E00573A5BF96218FF0C8FD968374E5F597D6D889664621176844E0D7518300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要对战倒是可以，\n不过，输了可要来打工哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815BF962185012662F53EF4EE5FF0C000A4E0D8FC7FF0C8F934E8653EF8981676562535DE554E6300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会赢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A8D620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不想这么做",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D60F38FD94E48505A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能一直烟雾缭绕，\n要熊熊燃烧才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD4E0076F470DF96FE7F2D7ED5FF0C000A8981718A718A71C370E7624D884CFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喷火龙啊，喷出黑暗的火焰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B7706B9F99554AFF0C55B751FA9ED166977684706B71305427FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那你想干什么啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F6060F35E724EC04E48554A2026202600100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会烧掉你的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A70E763894F607684FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想多了解一下大叔，\n比如他在闪焰队究竟做过什么事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3591A4E8689E34E004E0B592753D4FF0C000A6BD459824ED6572895EA7130961F7A767ADF505A8FC74EC04E484E8B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能让燃尽时的光芒闪耀夺目，\n就用超级进化来肆意燃烧吧，喷火龙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8680FD8BA971C35C3D65F676845149829295EA8000593A76EEFF0C000A5C3175288D857EA78FDB531667658086610F71C370E75427FF0C55B7706B9F99FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能作为新咖啡的一员重获新生，\n我要让你看看燃烧生命的超级进化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8680FD4F5C4E3A65B05496556176844E00545891CD83B765B0751FFF0C000A621189818BA94F60770B770B71C370E7751F547D76848D857EA78FDB5316FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要让你见识的不光是我们的牵绊……\n还有和大叔他们的牵绊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818BA94F6089C18BC676844E0D5149662F62114EEC768472757ECA20262026000A8FD86709548C592753D44ED64EEC768472757ECAFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还记得对战前的约定吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD88BB05F975BF96218524D76847EA65B9A5417FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F5371364E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大叔他……库瑟洛斯奇他\n为什么会在闪焰队活动呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592753D44ED6202620265E93745F6D1B65AF59474ED6000A4E3A4EC04E484F1A572895EA7130961F6D3B52A85462FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像宝可梦通过超级进化来强化一样，\n他当时在研究能否强化人类。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n研究的成果就是扩展强化服。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF5B9D53EF68A6901A8FC78D857EA78FDB531667655F3A53164E006837FF0C000A4ED65F5365F6572878147A7680FD54265F3A53164EBA7C7B300200100001BE01000A78147A7676846210679C5C31662F62695C555F3A5316670D300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本来应该是由我们来测试的，\n但不知为什么受试者变成了你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C67655E948BE5662F753162114EEC67656D4B8BD57684FF0C000A4F464E0D77E54E3A4EC04E4853D78BD5800553D862104E864F60300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们知道的就是这些了。\n毕竟我们和库瑟洛斯奇没什么往来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC77E5905376845C31662F8FD94E9B4E863002000A6BD57ADF62114EEC548C5E93745F6D1B65AF59476CA14EC04E485F806765300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大叔他很温柔的。\n所以我一直想知道他是个什么样的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592753D44ED65F886E2967D476843002000A62404EE562114E0076F460F377E590534ED6662F4E2A4EC04E48683776844EBA300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他应该是个把研究放在首位的人吧。\n不过，他也总想着要温柔对待你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED65E948BE5662F4E2A628A78147A76653E572899964F4D76844EBA54273002000A4E0D8FC7FF0C4ED64E5F603B60F3774089816E2967D45BF95F854F60300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人类总是会自相矛盾啊。\n你也这么认为吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA7C7B603B662F4F1A81EA76F877DB76FE554A3002000A4F604E5F8FD94E488BA44E3A5427FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回忆是不会变的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE5FC6662F4E0D4F1A53D876840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那份温柔是真实的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34EFD6E2967D4662F771F5B9E76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C22FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是给你的谢礼。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因为我感觉你让我明白了\n自己为什么没被基格尔德选上。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F7ED94F6076848C22793C300200100001BE01000A56E04E3A6211611F89C94F608BA96211660E767D4E86000A81EA5DF14E3A4EC04E486CA188AB57FA683C5C145FB790094E0A300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n古历装扮厨师套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A53E4538688C5626E53A85E08595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你想在新咖啡打工了，\n就穿上它吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F6060F3572865B05496556162535DE54E86FF0C000A5C317A7F4E0A5B835427300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那可不行。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>是个能为市里所有的\n宝可梦和人行动的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A353EF4E0D884C300200100001BE01000A0010000201000000662F4E2A80FD4E3A5E0291CC624067097684000A5B9D53EF68A6548C4EBA884C52A876844EBA300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能因为打工这种小事耽误了你。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n当然，如果新咖啡出了什么事的话，\n我还是会找你商量的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD56E04E3A62535DE58FD979CD5C0F4E8B803D8BEF4E864F60300200100001BE01000A5F537136FF0C5982679C65B05496556151FA4E864EC04E484E8B76848BDDFF0C000A62118FD8662F4F1A627E4F60554691CF7684300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来宝可梦和人们\n各种各样的生活方式，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n都渗透在密阿雷市的各个角落啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67655B9D53EF68A6548C4EBA4EEC000A540479CD540468377684751F6D3B65B95F0FFF0C00100001BE00000A90FD6E17900F57285BC6963F96F75E02768454044E2A89D2843D554A300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这可真是个煞风景的异次元密阿雷啊。\n到底是谁的愿望呀……？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EF771F662F4E2A715E98CE666F76845F026B2151435BC6963F96F7554A3002000A52305E95662F8C017684613F671B544020262026FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当侦探有机会接触到市里的\n各种事物，很有趣哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
